## Interface: 30300
## Title: Auctionator - AuctionSim Price Hint
## Version: 1.1.0
## Notes: Adds a read-only "AuctionSim suggests" price hint to Auctionator's Sell tab, sourced from the AuctionSim server module. Available to any character, not just GMs. Cannot change AuctionSim's pricing in any way.
## Dependencies: Auctionator

AuctionSimHint.lua
